<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan bolivar closes steady at 480.75/481.75.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan bolivar closes steady at 480.75/481.75.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed unchanged at 480.75/481.75 per dollar Friday, as the Central Bank met steady foreign currency demand, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was a pretty balanced market. The Central Bank was supplying (foreign currency) and final clients were buying,&quot; one said.</p>
<p>Currency markets were closed Thursday for the Labor Day public holiday.</p>
<p>Traders expect no sharp swings in the exchange rate next week.</p>
<p>((-- Silene Ramirez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
